    "R-LOCK-4",
    "TXN-RANGE"
  ],
  "description": "Repairs r-lock-3-4-txn/txn-range-close: b's competing write was refused and never retried after the resolution, so whether an unrelated update survives a close was not exercised. Phase 1: process a creates a second Workspace, opens the file in it, begins a transaction there and updates N of row 1; process b tries UPDATE V = V + 1 on row 2 (no transaction; DBEngine.Errors right before and after); a closes the second Workspace with its transaction open and reads rows 1, 2 and 64; b repeats the statement and reads. Phase 2: a begins a transaction on Workspaces(0) and updates row 1; b tries the row 2 statement; a closes its Database (transaction still open), reopens it and reads; b tries again; a calls Rollback and reads; b repeats the statement, waits 7 s and reads.",
  "callerSurface": "native-idispatch/x64",
  "invokeLcid": 1033,
  "observationRecipe": [
    "clearErrorInfoBefore",
    "excepinfo",
    "deferredFill",
    "errorInfo"
  ],
